# Copy to .env.local. Everything is optional; the prototype runs fully without a model key.

# Enables free-form "Ask a question" through Claude. Without it, the 20 example questions still work (deterministic).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5      # any Claude Sonnet 4.5 or newer model id
# AI_PROVIDER=local                      # force the no-network provider even if a key is present

# Path to the SQLite warehouse (default: ./warehouse/insights.db, created by `npm run seed`)
# WAREHOUSE_PATH=./warehouse/insights.db

# Headless Chromium for PDF reports. Auto-detected on most systems; set explicitly if needed,
# or run `npx playwright install chromium` once.
# CHROME_PATH=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome

# Change the synthetic universe (student names, patterns, outcomes) and re-run `npm run seed`
# SEED=csiu-2026
